# No environment variables are required to run this app.
#
# Nöbet Çizelgesi is local-first: all data lives in your browser (IndexedDB)
# and is synced to your own Google Drive. There is no server, no database
# and no password to configure — you can delete this file and nothing changes.
#
# Optional: override the bundled Google OAuth Client ID used for Drive sync
# (e.g. when self-hosting on a different origin).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=""
